        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer from Barú to Cartagena and check in at your hotel.\n\nThe rest of the day is yours. You can explore the city on your own, return to the historic centre or spend the evening by the sea. After a few quiet days on Barú, the return to Cartagena brings a change of scene, with fortification walls, squares, narrow streets and city cafés."
